Launch window: a quiet undo banner after Move to Trash (macOS). After trash, a banner "'Name' moved to Trash" with Undo, auto-dismiss ~6s. Undo puts the file back via trashItem resultingItemURL. Latest delete replaces the banner. apple/macOS/EDraftMacApp.swift is required for one change: capture resultingItemURL and return it from trash (LaunchActions.trash currently returns Void and the app passes nil). Without that, undo cannot be real. Also LaunchWindow.swift, optional banner sibling, and EDraftMacSurface tests.